{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p002247","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p002247"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p002247","label":"晉文侯（趙世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"晉文侯","mention_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao:m006-0017"]},{"surface":"先君文侯","mention_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao:m017-0104"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m006-0017","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p006","quote":"晉文侯"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m017-0104","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p017","quote":"先君文侯"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-043","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao:m006-0017","c-shiji-043-zhao:m017-0104"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao:p006","c-shiji-043-zhao:p017"],"passage_count":2}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-043-zhao"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m006-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"晉文侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002247","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p006","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m017-0104","start":104,"end":108,"surface":"先君文侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002247","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p017","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji043-018","person_id":"cbr-p002247","surfaces":["先君文侯","晉文侯"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p006","quote":"叔帶之時，周幽王無道，去周如晉，事晉文侯，始建趙氏于晉國。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p017","quote":"居十五年，晉景公疾，卜之，大業之後不遂者爲祟。景公問韓厥，厥知趙孤在，乃曰：「大業之後在晉絶祀者，其趙氏乎？夫自中衍者皆嬴姓也。中衍人面鳥噣，降佐殷帝大戊，及周天子，皆有明德。下及幽厲無道，而叔帶去周適晉，事先君文侯，至于成公，世有立功，未嘗絶祀。今吾君獨滅趙宗，國人哀之，故見龜策。唯君圖之。」景公問：「趙尚有後子孫乎？」韓厥具以實告。於是景公乃與韓厥謀立趙孤兒，召而匿之宮中。諸將入問疾，景公因韓厥之衆以脅諸將而見趙孤。趙孤名曰武。諸將不得已，乃曰：「昔下宮之難，屠岸賈爲之，矯以君命，并命群臣。非然，孰敢作難！微君之疾，群臣固且請立趙後。今君有命，群臣之願也。」於是召趙武、程嬰遍拜諸將，遂反與程嬰、趙武攻屠岸賈，滅其族。復與趙武田邑如故。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示名字、是為與連續事件暫接異稱；真孤與替代兒分開，馬匹、群體與闕代不當個人，不以模型記憶補熟知姓名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p006","text":"叔帶之時，周幽王無道，去周如晉，事晉文侯，始建趙氏于晉國。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m006-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"叔帶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002245","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m006-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"周幽王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002246","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m006-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"晉文侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002247","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p017","text":"居十五年，晉景公疾，卜之，大業之後不遂者爲祟。景公問韓厥，厥知趙孤在，乃曰：「大業之後在晉絶祀者，其趙氏乎？夫自中衍者皆嬴姓也。中衍人面鳥噣，降佐殷帝大戊，及周天子，皆有明德。下及幽厲無道，而叔帶去周適晉，事先君文侯，至于成公，世有立功，未嘗絶祀。今吾君獨滅趙宗，國人哀之，故見龜策。唯君圖之。」景公問：「趙尚有後子孫乎？」韓厥具以實告。於是景公乃與韓厥謀立趙孤兒，召而匿之宮中。諸將入問疾，景公因韓厥之衆以脅諸將而見趙孤。趙孤名曰武。諸將不得已，乃曰：「昔下宮之難，屠岸賈爲之，矯以君命，并命群臣。非然，孰敢作難！微君之疾，群臣固且請立趙後。今君有命，群臣之願也。」於是召趙武、程嬰遍拜諸將，遂反與程嬰、趙武攻屠岸賈，滅其族。復與趙武田邑如故。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m017-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"晉景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002269","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m017-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"大業","kind":"person","person_id":"c